  "slug": "coinvoyage-paykit-community",
  "name": "Coinvoyage Paykit Community",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Accept any crypto payments (Bitcoin, Solana, Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BSC, Sui, plus stablecoins like USDC/USDT) in any Claude-built app via CoinVoyage. Bundles a skill that triggers on crypto checkout / payment gateway work, plus an MCP server with 15 tools for creating and managing PayOrders, webhooks, and cross-chain swaps. Non-custodial — funds settle directly to the merchant's wallet.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `coinvoyage-payments` (Integrate CoinVoyage to accept crypto payments (BTC, SOL, ETH, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BSC, Sui, plus stablecoins like…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install coinvoyage-paykit-community@claude-community` from `KingPeque/coinvoyage-paykit`.",
